OL,3,AToxic haze from Indonesia spreads to
OL,4,AMalaysia and Philippines as wildfires
OL,5,Arage
OL,6,
OL,7,FIndonesia is battling massive
OL,8,Fwildfires, some of which have been
OL,9,Fburning for weeks
OL,11,FMillions of people in Sumatra and in
OL,12,FKalimantan, the Indonesian portion of
OL,13,FBorneo island, have been exposed to
OL,14,Ftoxic haze from the fires - BBC teams
OL,15,Fare there
OL,17,FHaze from the fires in Indonesia has
OL,18,Fbeen reported across the region -
OL,19,Fincluding in Malaysia and the
OL,20,FPhilippines
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
